  <!-- FAQ -->
  <style>
    #wk-{{ section.id }}-faq .wk-faq-a { display:none; }
    #wk-{{ section.id }}-faq .wk-faq.is-open .wk-faq-a { display:block; }
    #wk-{{ section.id }}-faq .wk-faq-ico { transition:transform .2s ease; }
    #wk-{{ section.id }}-faq .wk-faq.is-open .wk-faq-ico { transform:rotate(45deg); }
  </style>
  <section id="wk-{{ section.id }}-faq" style="background:#F5E6D8;padding:80px 28px;">
    <div style="max-width:1080px;margin:0 auto;">
      <h2 style="font-family:'Fraunces',serif;font-weight:400;font-size:38px;text-align:center;margin:0 0 48px;color:#6B3D42;">{{ section.settings.heading }}</h2>
      <div style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:0 48px;">
        {%- for col in (0..1) -%}
        <div>
          {%- assign start = col | times: 4 | plus: 1 -%}
          {%- assign last = start | plus: 3 -%}
          {%- for i in (start..last) -%}
            {%- assign qk = 'q' | append: i -%}
            {%- assign ak = 'a' | append: i -%}
            {%- assign q = section.settings[qk] -%}
            {%- if q != blank -%}
            <div class="wk-faq{% if i == 1 %} is-open{% endif %}" data-wk-faq style="border-top:1px solid rgba(107,61,66,0.2);">
              <button type="button" data-wk-faq-q style="width:100%;cursor:pointer;font-family:inherit;background:none;border:none;text-align:left;padding:22px 0;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:16px;"><span style="font-family:'Fraunces',serif;font-size:18px;color:#6B3D42;line-height:1.3;">{{ q }}</span><span class="wk-faq-ico" style="font-size:22px;color:#C9653F;font-weight:300;flex:0 0 auto;">+</span></button>
              <div class="wk-faq-a">{%- assign wk_faq_paras = section.settings[ak] | split: '||' -%}{%- for para in wk_faq_paras -%}<p style="font-size:14px;line-height:1.6;color:#4a3a30;margin:0 0 {% if forloop.last %}22{% else %}12{% endif %}px;">{{ para | strip }}</p>{%- endfor -%}</div>
            </div>
            {%- endif -%}
          {%- endfor -%}
        </div>
        {%- endfor -%}
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <script>
    (function(){
      var root = document.getElementById('wk-{{ section.id }}-faq');
      if (!root) return;
      var items = root.querySelectorAll('[data-wk-faq]');
      items.forEach(function(item){
        var btn = item.querySelector('[data-wk-faq-q]');
        if (!btn) return;
        btn.addEventListener('click', function(){
          var open = item.classList.contains('is-open');
          items.forEach(function(x){ x.classList.remove('is-open'); });
          if (!open) item.classList.add('is-open');
        });
      });
    })();
  </script>

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "Home · FAQ",
  "settings": [
    {"type": "text", "id": "heading", "label": "Heading", "default": "Frequently Asked Questions"},
    {"type": "header", "content": "Q1"},
    {"type": "text", "id": "q1", "label": "Question", "default": "Will this actually work for me, or is it another placebo?"},
    {"type": "textarea", "id": "a1", "label": "Answer", "default": "We built this formula because that's exactly what we refused to sell. Every active is at a clinically-relevant dose, printed on the label — no proprietary blends, no hidden under-dosing, zero sugar. The formula works on the root: the brain's thermostat and the gut-hormone axis. And if it doesn't work for you, it costs you nothing — we back that with our 90-day guarantee."},
    {"type": "header", "content": "Q2"},
    {"type": "text", "id": "q2", "label": "Question", "default": "Can I take it with my medications — and is it safe every day, long-term?"},
    {"type": "textarea", "id": "a2", "label": "Answer", "default": "There are no known interactions with common prescriptions like SSRIs, thyroid medication, blood pressure medication, or birth control — but if you take daily medication, please run it past your prescriber first. It's a quick conversation. For long-term daily use: yes. Our doses have established safety data, our six probiotic strains are among the most studied in the world, and every batch is third-party tested. Vegan, made in Europe, sugar-free."},
    {"type": "header", "content": "Q3"},
    {"type": "text", "id": "q3", "label": "Question", "default": "Does this contain hormones? I can’t take HRT."},
    {"type": "textarea", "id": "a3", "label": "Answer", "default": "No. There are no hormones in this. Not estrogen. Not progesterone. Not DHEA. Not “secretly kind of HRT.” || If you can’t take hormone therapy — or you don’t want to — that’s exactly who this was built for. Botanicals at researched doses, not a hormone in a gummy. || If you are already on HRT and want to add this, that’s a conversation with your clinician. Bring them the label. That’s why every milligram is printed."},
    {"type": "header", "content": "Q4"},
    {"type": "text", "id": "q4", "label": "Question", "default": "How long until I feel something — and what if I don’t?"},
    {"type": "textarea", "id": "a4", "label": "Answer", "default": "Some women notice quieter nights or spacing flashes around weeks 3–4. For a lot of people the clearer shift is closer to weeks 6–8. Full effect is a 30–90 day window. That’s the formula, not a delay tactic. || Take two a day and give it a real chance. If your nights, heat, mood, or energy haven’t moved in a way that matters to you, you don’t pay — keep the bottle."},
    {"type": "header", "content": "Q5"},
    {"type": "text", "id": "q5", "label": "Question", "default": "Is it too late for me? I'm past 50."},
    {"type": "textarea", "id": "a5", "label": "Answer", "default": "No. The systems our formula supports — the hypothalamus-thermostat axis and the estrobolome — don't switch off at menopause. Women in their mid-50s and beyond report the same pattern: flushes down from a dozen a day to a handful a week, dry sheets, real sleep. We built this for perimenopause <em>and</em> beyond. The only version of too late is another year you didn't have to spend soaked and sleepless."},
    {"type": "header", "content": "Q6"},
    {"type": "text", "id": "q6", "label": "Question", "default": "How does the subscription work — and can I cancel anytime?"},
    {"type": "textarea", "id": "a6", "label": "Answer", "default": "Subscribing gets you the best price with free shipping, and you're always in control: pause, skip, or cancel anytime, no hoops. You can also order a one-time purchase if you'd rather try it first. Our honest take: the real results land at month 3, and subscribers pay the lowest price to get there."},
    {"type": "header", "content": "Q7"},
    {"type": "text", "id": "q7", "label": "Question", "default": "What if it doesn't work for me?"},
    {"type": "textarea", "id": "a7", "label": "Answer", "default": "Email us within 90 days for a full refund — no returns, no forms, no fine print. The gut-hormone axis doesn't reset overnight, and a 30-day guarantee would ask you to quit before the shift happens. We give you a full three months because that's what your body actually needs — and we're betting on you, not on the fine print."},
    {"type": "header", "content": "Q8"},
    {"type": "text", "id": "q8", "label": "Question", "default": "What if I already take HRT, or other menopause supplements?"},
    {"type": "textarea", "id": "a8", "label": "Answer", "default": "This is not HRT and it does not replace HRT. || Some women use it because they can’t take hormones. Some use it because they don’t want to. Some are already on a prescription and want a non-hormonal option for sleep and heat — that is between you and your clinician. Bring them the label. || If you’re already taking other menopause blends, don’t stack three things and then guess which one did what. Pick a protocol. Give it 90 days."}
  ]
}
{% endschema %}
